{"seq":3,"slug":"statesman-and-general","title":"Statesman And General","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/statesman-and-general","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"suppressing-rebellions","title":"平定叛乱","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/statesman-and-general/suppressing-rebellions","wordCount":1593,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"final-years","title":"晚年与身后","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/statesman-and-general/final-years","wordCount":1605,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现王阳明的赫赫事功与晚年。这位心学大师，更是一位卓越的军事家——他平定多次地方叛乱，尤其以少胜多、运筹帷幄地平定了宁王朱宸濠之乱，建立了不朽的功业，这正是其\"知行合一\"思想的生动实践。晚年，他讲学传道、揭出\"致良知\"，并临危受命、平定广西叛乱，最终以\"此心光明，亦复何言\"的遗言从容离世。本章呈现王阳明\"三不朽\"完人的完整人生。\n"}